OL,4,CPM urges social media companies to     
OL,5,C'show some decency' and take down      
OL,6,CBrand video                            
OL,7,GSocial media companies should "show    
OL,8,Gsome decency and take these videos     
OL,9,Gdown", the prime minister has said,    
OL,10,Gfollowing a government attempt to have 
OL,11,Ga YouTube video featuring a message    
OL,12,Gfrom the jailed comedian removed.      
OL,14,FThe site's owner Google refused a      
OL,15,Fgovernment request to remove the clip  
OL,16,Fposted by Brand's wife in which he     
OL,17,Fclaims his innocence, Whitehall        
OL,18,Fsources have told the BBC.             
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
