OL,4,CUK and EU to agree youth mobility      
OL,5,Cscheme, BBC understands                
OL,6,GUp to 100,000 young people from the EU 
OL,7,Gwould be allowed to travel, work and   
OL,8,Gstudy in the UK per year under a new   
OL,9,Gyouth mobility scheme set to be agreed 
OL,10,Gon Friday, the BBC understands.        
OL,12,FThe same number of young Britons would 
OL,13,Fbe allowed into Europe under the       
OL,14,Fscheme, expected to be approved at the 
OL,15,FUK-EU summit in Brussels. Downing      
OL,16,FStreet has not commented on the        
OL,17,Fdetails, but said talks were "down to  
OL,18,Fthe wire" on Thursday.                 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
